WEBVTT

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:21.740
I got out of bed...

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:24.190
one morning...

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:30.630
only to find out that I have a new sister.

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:33.220
Good morning.

00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:37.180
Sorry! I mixed up our rooms!

00:00:44.570 --> 00:00:47.480
Let's eat!

00:00:48.050 --> 00:00:49.150
Have this, too!

00:00:56.750 --> 00:00:58.770
What time does your flight leave today?

00:01:00.070 --> 00:01:01.740
I believe it's at five.

00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:02.960
Four.

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:04.170
Close enough.

00:01:04.170 --> 00:01:06.710
"Close enough" my left foot.

00:01:07.110 --> 00:01:10.750
There aren't many flights going to India, so you'd better be careful.

00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:12.930
It'll all work out, trust me.

00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:14.420
Honestly, dear.

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:18.730
If I have to, I'll just catch your
flight tomorrow, Kyouko-san.

00:01:18.730 --> 00:01:20.100
That flight's fully booked.

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:24.330
Then I'll just wait another six months.
That was my original plan anyway.

00:01:24.330 --> 00:01:26.060
Don't be silly!

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:30.020
Who else will draw up their blueprints, Tetsuya-kun?

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:34.240
So they say. But why push this trip up six months?

00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:36.930
I was looking forward to spending time with you guys.

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:40.130
Those Indians sure know when to butt in.

00:01:40.130 --> 00:01:41.200
Mitsuki-chan,

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:42.950
do you want anything from my trip?

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:46.970
Maybe a doll or something?

00:01:46.970 --> 00:01:48.760
She's not a kid, you know.

00:01:48.760 --> 00:01:50.770
She is to me, geez.

00:01:51.470 --> 00:01:56.130
If anything happens while we're gone, don't be afraid to ask him anything.

00:01:56.130 --> 00:01:57.300
Now wait...

00:01:57.300 --> 00:02:00.910
Why not? We're a family now.

00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:04.270
Thanks for the food.

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:20.210
Mitsuki-chan, take care!

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:29.220
Bye. Have a safe trip, Dad.

00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:30.050
Sure.

00:02:30.050 --> 00:02:32.210
I'll see you later, Yuuya-kun!

00:02:32.210 --> 00:02:33.470
Goodbye.

00:02:41.180 --> 00:02:43.640
You have a little sister?

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:45.430
A <i>stepsister,</i> okay?

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:47.430
God, you're so lucky!

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:50.970
Why? I thought you had a little sister yourself.

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:55.300
You putz. She's my real, blood-related sister.

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:56.960
And now that she's in eighth grade,

00:02:56.960 --> 00:03:00.710
she acts all snotty and treats me
like garbage—a total turnoff!

00:03:00.710 --> 00:03:03.140
That's why little sisters have to be stepsiblings!

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:05.950
You're not making sense.

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:06.910
How is she?

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:09.270
Does she bake you treats?

00:03:09.270 --> 00:03:11.250
Do you share the same bed?

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:12.690
God, no.

00:03:12.690 --> 00:03:15.730
Oh crap! You take baths together?!

00:03:15.730 --> 00:03:20.100
She only moved in yesterday. We hardly even talked.

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:21.470
Any cell phone pics?

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:23.030
Nope.

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:24.850
There she is.

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:25.770
Where?

00:03:27.380 --> 00:03:27.870
There?

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:29.480
Wow, she's cute!

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:31.990
Now <i>that's</i> a little sister!

00:03:31.990 --> 00:03:33.370
Based on what?

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:40.320
In ancient Japan, men used to call their little sisters "imo."

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:46.960
In time, they began using that term with any woman they were close to,

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:50.520
including their lovers and their wives, regardless of age.

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:55.960
<i>She's pretty slow. She should have
eaten something this morning.</i>

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:02.340
<i>She's smiling.</i>

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:05.980
Theory has it that men treated their wives and lovers like little sisters

00:04:05.980 --> 00:04:12.690
because marriages between siblings
were common in those days.

00:04:16.570 --> 00:04:17.330
Hey!

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:21.290
Sorry about this morning.

00:04:21.290 --> 00:04:25.630
That used to be my room, so it was an honest mistake.

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:31.930
I'm also sorry, for taking your room.

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:39.310
<i>I don't get little sisters.</i>

00:04:41.730 --> 00:04:44.550
<i>We're a family now.</i>

00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:48.190
Mitsuki-chan!

00:04:50.550 --> 00:04:53.350
M... Mitsuki-san?

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:57.170
Mitsuki-kun?

00:04:57.170 --> 00:04:58.090
Mitsuki-dono?

00:04:58.090 --> 00:04:59.320
Mitsuki-han?

00:05:00.590 --> 00:05:04.780
Look, I know it'll take some time getting used to a new home and a new school,

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:08.170
so if you need anything, just ask.

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:19.420
Mitsuki!

00:05:23.720 --> 00:05:24.630
Mitsuki!

00:05:25.190 --> 00:05:27.030
Hey! You all right?

00:05:27.030 --> 00:05:28.970
Mitsuki! Stay with me!

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:30.050
Did you hit your head?

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:35.520
Hey! Mitsuki!

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:42.400
Are you her brother?

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:44.850
Her step... er, uh...

00:05:45.770 --> 00:05:47.260
Yes, I am.

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:48.860
Our mother will be coming soon.

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:54.010
I didn't see any signs of external trauma, so I believe she just passed out.

00:05:54.010 --> 00:05:57.170
But just to be sure, we'll do a
full exam once she comes to.

00:05:57.170 --> 00:05:58.830
Yes, please.

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:09.130
You're awake.

00:06:12.210 --> 00:06:13.590
Huh?

00:06:13.590 --> 00:06:16.390
You passed out and fell off the walkway.

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:17.770
Don't you remember?

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:20.100
What is it?

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:21.720
Your nose.

00:06:21.720 --> 00:06:23.240
Oh, this?

00:06:23.240 --> 00:06:26.610
I sort of hit it when I caught you.

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:30.590
You... caught me when I fell.

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:44.740
Your mo... Kyouko-san will be here
soon. Everything will be fine.

00:06:44.740 --> 00:06:46.770
Are you hurt anywhere?

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:49.970
You must be thirsty.

00:06:50.390 --> 00:06:51.760
I'll go buy you something.

00:06:54.230 --> 00:06:55.770
Anything you'd like-

00:06:55.770 --> 00:06:56.810
Mitsuki?

00:06:58.610 --> 00:06:59.410
What's wrong?

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:02.480
You don't feel good? I'll call the doctor-

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:06.010
I finally get to talk to you...

00:07:07.630 --> 00:07:09.490
Yuuya-oniichan.

00:07:18.710 --> 00:07:20.050
Onii-chan...

00:07:21.350 --> 00:07:22.790
You know what?

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:25.570
I've always, always...

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:30.050
D-Don't touch me!

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:34.230
What happened?

00:07:34.230 --> 00:07:36.560
D-Doctor.

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:40.980
My sister's... acting kind of funny.

00:07:41.530 --> 00:07:45.280
Pay attention, I’m sensitive. Take notice.
BINKAN ni ATTENTION kizuite yo

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:52.280
I’m sensitive, but there’s a solution to that!
BINKAN ni SOLUTION jiwa jiwa kiteru

