are racing toward Ground Zero.
kagirinaku zero chiten e

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:08.100
ATTENTION

00:09:28.010 --> 00:09:30.250
Be sure to thank him once we get home.

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:33.040
Say, "Thank you for saving me."

00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:35.810
You two will start living together
on your own tomorrow,

00:09:35.810 --> 00:09:37.810
so you need to start bonding.

00:09:40.770 --> 00:09:42.600
We're home.

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:44.150
Welcome back.

00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:48.940
Mitsuki?!

00:09:58.490 --> 00:09:59.910
Mitsuki?

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:01.450
Mitsuki!

00:10:06.950 --> 00:10:08.870
Forgive us, Yuuya-kun.

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:10.100
It's fine.

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:11.960
Did everything check out at the hospital?

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:13.350
Yes.

00:10:13.350 --> 00:10:16.920
But how on earth could she fall from a walkway?

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:19.730
Maybe she lost her footing.

00:10:19.730 --> 00:10:21.390
Did my dad make it to the airport on time?

00:10:21.900 --> 00:10:25.450
I took him to the station myself, so he should be fine.

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:26.650
Thanks.

00:10:26.650 --> 00:10:29.070
His job is the only thing he's good at.

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:32.690
I have to go see Nanami.

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:33.520
Right.

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:37.010
I got everything out for dinner.
I just need to go to the minimart.

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:45.400
<i>What's happening to me?</i>

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:47.670
<i>Why did I do that?</i>

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:53.750
<i>It felt like... I was watching a
completely different person.</i>

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:57.870
<i>I finally get to talk to you, Yuuya</i>-<i>oniichan.</i>

00:10:58.930 --> 00:11:04.050
<i>It... felt so... weird.</i>

00:11:13.010 --> 00:11:14.900
Kanzaki Mitsuki.

00:11:15.080 --> 00:11:17.280
I will eliminate you!

00:11:34.970 --> 00:11:37.670
<i>What was that all about?</i>

00:11:46.320 --> 00:11:48.390
It's all wrinkled!

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:52.990
Huh? There's something on my hips.

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:02.070
What is this?

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:07.030
Did they put this on me back at the hospital?

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:08.670
That's your T.S.T.

00:12:08.670 --> 00:12:09.540
Who said that?

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:15.710
Kotobuki Hiyori. Your friendly neighborhood ghost!

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:32.060
A-A ghost? You're kidding!

00:12:32.970 --> 00:12:35.060
Wait, she was at that walkway.

00:12:37.790 --> 00:12:39.530
What are you doing?

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:45.700
<i>Who is this girl?</i>

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:48.030
No!

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:57.170
Oh God, it feels so great having a real body.

00:12:58.590 --> 00:13:00.170
Is that me?

00:13:01.310 --> 00:13:04.880
This must all be pretty shocking. Sorry about that.

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:07.890
But I'm still borrowing your body.

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:09.050
Borrowing?

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:10.890
You know, "possessing"?

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:12.270
Possessing?

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:14.300
I-I'm transparent!

00:13:14.300 --> 00:13:17.920
I must have died after falling from the walkway!

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:20.740
What are you doing?!

00:13:20.740 --> 00:13:23.030
It's been so long...

00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:25.990
since I had a body.

00:13:26.780 --> 00:13:31.040
You may have small boobs, but they're nice and sensitive.

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:33.250
Stop that!

00:13:36.970 --> 00:13:38.310
I'm back!

00:13:38.310 --> 00:13:41.620
Hey, don't interrupt me!

00:13:41.620 --> 00:13:43.880
<i>I'm</i> interrupting <i>you?</i>

00:13:44.830 --> 00:13:48.590
Then let's do it together and
get to <i>really</i> know each other.

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:49.710
Wha...

00:13:50.570 --> 00:13:52.060
Hey, what are you...

00:13:53.930 --> 00:13:56.440
<i>Who is this girl?</i>

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:03.650
<i>What?</i>

00:14:14.510 --> 00:14:16.290
Hey... quit it...

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:23.840
Don't...

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:32.220
I said don't...

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:42.310
Onii-chan...

00:14:42.310 --> 00:14:43.750
<i>"Onii</i>-<i>chan"?</i>

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:46.070
Yuuya-oniichan...

00:14:46.070 --> 00:14:46.900
Stop!

00:15:00.850 --> 00:15:02.150
That was great!

00:15:02.770 --> 00:15:04.340
Hold on!

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:06.190
What about this?

00:15:06.190 --> 00:15:07.290
The T.S.T.?

00:15:07.290 --> 00:15:09.050
How do you take it off?

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:12.550
But why? You've just had it put on!

00:15:12.550 --> 00:15:15.140
People can't see me wearing this!

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:17.270
Just push the gauge.

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:23.850
Oh, but once you press it...

00:15:23.850 --> 00:15:24.360
Listen here, ghost!
Oh, but once you press it...

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:25.810
Listen here, ghost!

00:15:25.810 --> 00:15:27.230
My name's "Hiyori."

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:29.950
Where are my panties?

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:32.630
The ones I was wearing! Give them back!

00:15:32.630 --> 00:15:34.480
Oh, those.

00:15:34.480 --> 00:15:35.670
Where <i>did</i> they go?

00:15:35.670 --> 00:15:37.430
Stop acting dumb!

00:15:37.430 --> 00:15:38.650
First of all...

00:15:39.830 --> 00:15:41.670
What's wrong?

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:45.430
Oh, you have to pee!

00:15:45.430 --> 00:15:46.690
Did your tummy get cold?

00:15:46.690 --> 00:15:48.260
Shut up!

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:11.790
You naughty girl!

00:16:11.790 --> 00:16:13.570
This is your fault!

00:16:16.810 --> 00:16:18.550
It's been three minutes already?

00:16:18.550 --> 00:16:20.270
What are you saying?

00:16:20.270 --> 00:16:23.540
It re-attaches itself after three minutes.

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:26.750
God... talk about aggravating.

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:30.210
Huh?

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:33.190
So, why isn't it coming off?

00:16:33.190 --> 00:16:36.390
It won't come off for an hour after re-attaching itself.

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:37.330
What?!

00:16:37.330 --> 00:16:39.220
What if I need to use the bathroom?

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:41.960
That's what those three minutes are for.

00:16:41.960 --> 00:16:43.350
They've thought of everything.

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:45.150
Tell me sooner!

00:16:45.150 --> 00:16:47.690
You pushed it before I could tell you.

00:16:48.070 --> 00:16:51.900
So you mean I can't go for an hour?

00:16:52.420 --> 00:16:53.170
Go do what?

00:16:53.170 --> 00:16:54.290
Shut up!

00:16:58.310 --> 00:16:59.410
Kanzaki.

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:04.120
Out shopping?

00:17:05.930 --> 00:17:07.410
Oh, Neko!

00:17:07.410 --> 00:17:09.500
Yeah, sort of. What about you?

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:10.490
Out on a stroll.

00:17:10.490 --> 00:17:13.100
It's dark out. Should I walk you home?

00:17:13.100 --> 00:17:14.430
Don't worry about me.

00:17:14.430 --> 00:17:17.970
You need to hurry home. Your new sister is waiting.

00:17:17.970 --> 00:17:20.180
Huh? Did I tell you about her?

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:21.920
I heard from Torii.

00:17:21.920 --> 00:17:24.140
How <i>is</i> your sister?

00:17:27.190 --> 00:17:28.690
I don't get her.

00:17:30.310 --> 00:17:32.050
I'm home!

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:36.250
What's with you? What are you even thinking?

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:40.120
Why are you forcing me to wear this... thing!

00:17:40.120 --> 00:17:42.090
It's not a "thing"!

00:17:42.090 --> 00:17:47.040
The T.S.T. is a brand-name article from Heaven—a trusted product!

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:50.090
And besides, I wasn't the one who put it on you.

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:52.110
You're driving me...

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:55.330
Mitsuki, is something wrong?

00:17:55.330 --> 00:17:56.970
I-It's nothing!

00:17:56.970 --> 00:17:58.800
Is someone else in there?

00:17:58.800 --> 00:18:01.720
No! Of course not!

00:18:01.720 --> 00:18:03.100
Weren't you talking to...

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:03.890
No way! You were just imagining it!
Weren't you talking to...

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:05.530
No way! You were just imagining it!

00:18:08.440 --> 00:18:10.790
Can you see me once you're done?

00:18:10.790 --> 00:18:14.470
I've already talked to Nanami
about your living arrangements.

00:18:15.310 --> 00:18:16.230
Sure.

00:18:16.990 --> 00:18:20.160
Okay, dinner will be ready shortly.

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:23.520
I also bought your favorite: Imochou's sweet-potato jelly.

00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:25.110
We can eat it after dinner.

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:28.670
Nanami? Who's that?

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:30.270
My aunt.

00:18:31.030 --> 00:18:34.030
She'll stop by from time to time to check up on us.

00:18:35.950 --> 00:18:37.760
Wait, that reminds me.

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:41.470
You were calling him "Yuuya-oniichan"-

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:46.220
Mitsuki, what's wrong?

00:18:46.220 --> 00:18:49.010
We'll... talk later.

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:51.900
I'm home!

00:18:53.070 --> 00:18:54.850
Welcome back!

00:18:54.850 --> 00:18:57.360
Yuuya-kun, come here.

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:02.070
Hey, Mitsuki-san!

00:19:02.070 --> 00:19:03.430
Leave me alone.

00:19:03.430 --> 00:19:06.340
One move will make me leak.

00:19:06.340 --> 00:19:09.210
You can do it! Only five more minutes!

00:19:10.110 --> 00:19:10.810
Mitsuki?

00:19:10.810 --> 00:19:12.040
Onii-chan!

00:19:12.040 --> 00:19:14.500
What's wrong? Are you sick?

00:19:15.350 --> 00:19:17.490
Don't talk to me.

00:19:17.490 --> 00:19:20.530
I... I'm fine.

00:19:20.530 --> 00:19:23.800
Then come out. You're worrying Kyouko-san.

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:25.650
Leave me alone!

00:19:25.650 --> 00:19:29.980
I... can't... right now.

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:32.060
What's with that attitude?

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:36.230
Kyouko-san will be leaving tomorrow,
so you shouldn't worry her.

00:19:36.230 --> 00:19:38.970
I told you, nothing's wrong!

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:45.330
You don't need to... worry about me!

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:48.910
Then come out. You're making
us think something <i>is</i> wrong.

00:19:48.910 --> 00:19:50.870
You don't have to think that!

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:59.340
Look, if this has anything to do with what happened this morning, I apologize.

00:19:59.680 --> 00:20:02.530
If something's bothering you, you should tell me.

00:20:03.340 --> 00:20:07.670
You're my sister now, and tomorrow
we'll be living on our own.

00:20:09.210 --> 00:20:09.980
Ugh...

00:20:09.980 --> 00:20:13.440
God! Will you move it along!

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:14.980
Onii-chan!

00:20:16.010 --> 00:20:17.860
What the... omigod!

00:20:17.860 --> 00:20:19.860
You idiot! You'll make me leak!

00:20:20.810 --> 00:20:22.530
<i>I can't move!</i>

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:25.690
<i>If I move an inch, I'm done for!</i>

00:20:25.690 --> 00:20:27.240
Mitsuki?

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:29.290
O... Onii...

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:31.650
Onii-cha...

00:20:32.870 --> 00:20:34.880
What are you thinking?

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:36.610
What's wrong, Mitsuki?!

00:20:36.610 --> 00:20:38.340
Did something happen? Answer me!

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:41.590
Hold on! I'll get Kyouko-san!

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:46.850
Oh god. I... can't.

00:20:47.770 --> 00:20:50.220
Ah, only 20 seconds left.

00:20:57.860 --> 00:20:59.320
Ten seconds!

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:04.490
Five!

00:21:04.490 --> 00:21:05.490
Four!

00:21:05.490 --> 00:21:06.490
Three!

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:07.490
Two!

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:08.250
One!

00:21:08.250 --> 00:21:09.580
Zero!

00:21:18.590 --> 00:21:21.320
Please hug me tight.

00:21:21.320 --> 00:21:23.920
The man of my dreams with the charming do.

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:26.800
Come closer to me.

00:21:26.800 --> 00:21:29.680
Let’s make things more exciting.

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:43.000
I want you to notice

00:21:43.000 --> 00:21:46.240
how much I feel like flailing about.

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:48.540
I’ll gather up whatever courage I have

00:21:48.540 --> 00:21:51.700
and go full throttle towards you.

00:21:51.700 --> 00:21:54.070
Whenever a girl gets serious,

00:21:54.070 --> 00:21:57.290
you can’t imagine how far she’ll go.

00:21:57.290 --> 00:21:59.550
Raise the readings of my heart-shaped gauge

00:21:59.550 --> 00:22:02.630
and take me beyond the clouds.

00:22:02.630 --> 00:22:05.260
These ordinary days

00:22:05.260 --> 00:22:08.140
are something special to me.

00:22:08.140 --> 00:22:13.640
They’re like miracles covered in light.

00:22:13.640 --> 00:22:19.350
If I don’t act now, my feelings will stay bottled up.

00:22:19.350 --> 00:22:24.780
It's painful regretting what could have been.

00:22:24.780 --> 00:22:27.490
You’re my man with the charming do

00:22:27.490 --> 00:22:30.270
who makes my heart throb like no one else.

00:22:30.270 --> 00:22:32.980
Well you see, that’s because

00:22:32.980 --> 00:22:36.000
I love you very much.

00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:38.540
You make my heart race whenever I’m with you.

00:22:38.540 --> 00:22:41.210
But your charming do makes me stronger.

00:22:41.210 --> 00:22:44.080
I want to keep on loving you

00:22:44.080 --> 00:22:46.710
always and forever more.

00:22:51.170 --> 00:22:52.110
What?

00:22:52.110 --> 00:22:55.210
It's from Kyouko-san. She says it's from the hospital.

00:22:55.870 --> 00:22:57.350
And this is from me.

00:22:57.990 --> 00:23:01.770
They used to give me this whenever I got sick.

00:23:02.890 --> 00:23:04.230
Thanks.

00:23:04.230 --> 00:23:05.470
Sure thing.

00:23:05.470 --> 00:23:06.350
See you.

00:23:10.200 --> 00:23:10.790
<b>HERMIT MOVERS</b>

00:23:10.790 --> 00:23:12.660
Hey, what's that?
<b>HERMIT MOVERS</b>

00:23:12.660 --> 00:23:14.490
Is that a present?

00:23:14.490 --> 00:23:15.410
Idiot.

00:23:17.630 --> 00:23:19.270
Panties.

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:24.000
Next time on <i>Recently,
My Sister Is Unusual:</i>

00:23:24.370 --> 00:23:26.500
Are you feeling
sick or something?

00:23:26.970 --> 00:23:29.470
I can't ask for a bathroom break!

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:32.550
Whoa, she's fast.

00:23:32.550 --> 00:23:35.600
I swear, Mitsuki-chan is too cute!

00:23:35.600 --> 00:23:36.720
You're wrong!

00:23:37.260 --> 00:23:38.960
Tonight's your first night.
